  "extraction_notes": "The page shows \"Free forever, no credit card needed\" tier at the top but does not explicitly state the email limit for the Free plan. The pricing page includes a toggle between \"Monthly\" and \"Yearly (up to -30%)\" which indicates annual billing discount. Annual prices converted to per-month: Starter $97/year = $8.08/month; Standard $194/year = $16.17/month; Professional $5389/year = $449.08/month. The page states these are promotional annual rates with up to -30% discount. Professional plan pricing shows \"Starting from $499 per month\", indicating this may be a base price. Enterprise pricing requires contacting sales. The plan features listed include items like \"Sales Essentials\" and \"Sales Advanced\" which appear to be tiers within the platform but are not standard feature names from the specified list, so they were not included. Features like \"custom branding\" (no Brevo logo), \"api access\", \"phone support\", \"dedicated account manager\", and \"onboarding support\" were extracted where clearly stated.",
